{
  "id": "dialogue/yusuf-demir-exit-map",
  "person": "person/yusuf-demir",
  "name": "優素福・德米爾",
  "topics": [
    {
      "topic": "寫在背面的出口",
      "when": {
        "cmp": {
          "a": {
            "ref": "flags.dlg-yusuf-demir-exit-map"
          },
          "op": "==",
          "b": 0
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        "你翻開優素福的野外筆記，殼紋背面全是退路。「導師說我不像來找真相的。」",
        "他揉著額角，把紙扶正。「真相若不肯留門，我就先替大家畫一扇。」"
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "讓他把筆記合上休息。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "flag": "dlg-yusuf-demir-exit-map"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "用團款添置耐潮紙與遮光布。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "ledger": {
                "account": "cash",
                "delta": -80,
                "reason": "event-yusuf-demir-exit-map"
              }
            },
            {
              "flag": "dlg-yusuf-demir-exit-map"
            },
            {
              "mood": {
                "person/yusuf-demir": 1
              }
            }
          ],
          "requires": {
            "cmp": {
              "a": {
                "ref": "ledger.balances.cash"
              },
              "op": ">=",
              "b": 80
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "寫在背面的出口・後話",
      "when": {
        "cmp": {
          "a": {
            "ref": "flags.dlg-yusuf-demir-exit-map"
          },
          "op": ">=",
          "b": 1
        }
      },
      "lines": [
        "你把筆記還給優素福。他先摸紙邊，再看你。「出口也抄一份給你。別只讓我知道。」"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
